			"notes": "- Fix a bug with Chaos Effects triggering while watching the end credits\n- Sudden Death now ends early if the player dies too much or too quickly (to prevent infinite death loops)\n- Fixed desync on Raindow\n- New `applicable` subcommand to show if an effect (or which effects) are applicable or not.\n- Enchantment now correctly removes existing enchants from an enchanted item and correctly applies new enchantments to it"
		},
